WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.480
UFOs are real. We have proof. The United States&nbsp;
military has been studying them. There's one case&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.040
in particular that I can't stop thinking about.&nbsp;
It's this case from November 2004 off the coast&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:16.560
of California. The military report from the&nbsp;
day tells a story of this blue sky “unlimited&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:22.440
visibility” day. Of an aircraft carrier that&nbsp;
detects “multiple anomalous aerial vehicles”&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:29.040
descending “very rapidly” from 60,000 feet down&nbsp;
to 50 feet in a matter of seconds. These flying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:33.960
things just hover, they “stay stationary on the&nbsp;
radar for a short time, and then they depart at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:38.580
high velocities and turn rates.” So they sent&nbsp;
out these pilots to go chase these things down&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:42.900
and see what was going on. And they actually&nbsp;
got video of this stuff. The report describes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:49.380
it as “an elongated Tic Tac shape about 47 feet&nbsp;
in length, solid white, smooth with no edges or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:54.600
wings.” As a journalist, I am incredibly skeptical&nbsp;
of all things paranormal. Okay? Do we have proof&nbsp;&nbsp;

